# Backend rules

- Keep packages under `com.opportunityboard`; follow existing controller → service → repository flow.
- API paths stay under `/api/v1`. Do not break JWT auth filters in `SecurityConfig`.
- Config secrets via env: `DB_PASSWORD`, `JWT_SECRET`, optional `DB_URL` / `MAIL_*`.
- Tests: prefer `mvn -B verify`; do not disable JaCoCo/Sonar wiring without asking.
- Dockerfile builds fat JAR; App Platform health check uses `/api/v1/categories`.
